{"name": "Wild Growth", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"128\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467850/extras/fb2e602e2c554fafea76bfb99cf6d20d.poster.avif?t=1773908759\" width=\"620\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467850/extras/fb2e602e2c554fafea76bfb99cf6d20d.webm?t=1773908759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467850/extras/fb2e602e2c554fafea76bfb99cf6d20d.mp4?t=1773908759\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Playing as the healer, you have the all-important role of keeping your friends alive. Click with your mouse to cast healing spells. Don\u2019t let your warband die!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"128\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467850/extras/f3b66554534464c604806c26f687af83.poster.avif?t=1773908759\" width=\"620\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467850/extras/f3b66554534464c604806c26f687af83.webm?t=1773908759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467850/extras/f3b66554534464c604806c26f687af83.mp4?t=1773908759\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recruit new members to your warband. Try out different formations on the battlefield. Unlock allies such as fiery mages and tanky tanks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"128\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467850/extras/ebfada9c5016427c525f3a974e7130df.poster.avif?t=1773908759\" width=\"620\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467850/extras/ebfada9c5016427c525f3a974e7130df.webm?t=1773908759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467850/extras/ebfada9c5016427c525f3a974e7130df.mp4?t=1773908759\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can't win them all. Even if the battle is lost, the war has just begun! Patch yourself up at home base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"128\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467850/extras/09a1c7c7e76a56cf1c56d67250958e5c.poster.avif?t=1773908759\" width=\"620\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467850/extras/09a1c7c7e76a56cf1c56d67250958e5c.webm?t=1773908759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467850/extras/09a1c7c7e76a56cf1c56d67250958e5c.mp4?t=1773908759\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The upgrade tree is full of surprises, explore and see what\u2019s hiding behind the branches.\u00a0Spend your well earned currency and upgrade your powers. Repeat!</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Wild Growth is a short, actionpacked incremental healer game set in a grim norse world.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467850/c9898851d7391f8808110308ec64486baec642ba/header.jpg?t=1773908759", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Incremental", "Strategy", "Casual", "2D", "Linear", "Pixel Graphics"], "developers": "Cuddle Monster Games", "publishers": "Cuddle Monster Games", "release_date": "Dec 1, 2025", "price": "$4.99", "appid": "2467850", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "17 February 2025 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/68DhbhCYvek", "first_seen": 1739750400.0, "review_rank": 1917}